  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Golden Hour — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>Finally at 18th level, you have created a domain imbued with your perfected technique. At initiative 20, you can stop time and immediately take one turn as your domain empowers you. Whenever you stop time in your domain using your technique, you stop time for an additional turn.</p>",
